    "turn_idx": 99,
    "turn_text": "I met with my constituents to explore a variety of issues, often dealing with euthanization and with some of the challenges that are being faced by animal shelters. A lot of them have only a very small federal nexus, so that makes it hard to legislate federally. In some cases it's state law, in other cases it's County policy, often it's a question of resources at the local level. And so we can, through my office, try to raise awareness of the issues, but there's not always a federal legislative solution.",
